(1 Purpose) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how equipment cleaning is carried out at Lakemoor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 Scope) Tj T*
(Applies to all equipment cleaning activities in production and quality control at Lakemoor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 Responsibilities) Tj T*
(The process owner, Liam Ishikawa, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it \(revised in revision 03\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 Procedure) Tj T*
(Step 1: Document the area is free of previous materials.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Escalate the result against the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Verify the second-person check.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Record the batch number.) Tj T*
(Step 5: Inspect the logbook entry.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 Records) Tj T*
(Records of equipment cleaning are kept for five years after batch expiry \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
